{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1500793-npcs-stats-or-no-stats","id":1500793,"title":"NPCs: Stats or no stats?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-19T17:27:40-08:00","id":1500793,"title":"NPCs: Stats or no stats?","content":"I've been working on a module of various Garou for the ST to use, and have finished the individual write ups. <br /> <br /> now I'm wondering: as a ST, would you want stat blocks or not? I've been asking other sources, but figured I'd ask here too. Some people like having stats, others would rather make them themselves, so I'm just wondering what the consensus here is. <br /> <br /> I'm already including, ofc, Auspice/Tribe/Rank, and gift suggestions. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27762-jackal-alltrades","name":"Jackal Alltrades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-20T08:36:34-08:00","id":1500844,"title":"","content":"Honestly I almost never make stat block unless they are really needed. Most my NPCs are names and some bullet points about the character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12895-mrnatas","name":"MrNatas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12895_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-20T09:21:35-08:00","id":1500846,"title":"","content":"Nah, too much effort. My thoughts are along the lines of &quot;six dice sounds about right for him&quot; and &quot;that gift because it'd be fun&quot;. My memory is usually good enough to be consistent with what little information I've used before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T04:03:53-08:00","id":1500915,"title":"","content":"A good outline and interesting plothooks are all a writeup needs. The stats are easy to work out and take an absurd amount of page space.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-23T19:16:25-08:00","id":1501204,"title":"","content":"Thank you! That really cuts my time down. I'm of the same mind, myself, so that's good to hear and much appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27762-jackal-alltrades","name":"Jackal Alltrades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-27T11:16:24-08:00","id":1501475,"title":"","content":"For me, almost all the important NPCs have to have statblocks; especially in a session that will have combat. I'd rather be prepared than fumble around improvising on the spot.<br /> <br /> I've done many games where I primarily improvised, but those games were always really bad quality in my opinion. It takes longer, but it's better just to be prepared with the key characters beforehand. Minor nonsequential NPCs are the only time I improvise stats on the fly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-27T11:30:39-08:00","id":1501476,"title":"","content":"Golden rule for NPCs. If it has stats it is killable. So no stats only for NPCs who are so mighty that you have no chance (like a methusalah against a single whelp) or so weak they will get oneshot.<br /> Everyone on a niveau similar to Players should have stats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-30T02:43:01-08:00","id":1501678,"title":"","content":"No need for a stat block. That said I don't have mind having a couple of basic mechanical descriptions - maybe a list of 4 or 5 Gifts the character might have access to that could reasonably be relevant for their role in a game. Maybe a mention of an important Merit or Background (&quot;Hearteater possesses the Grand Library Merit at 2 dots representing the collected books he has accumulated over the last decade. If the players characters manage to finish all of his tasks, he can transfer ownership of these books, and the merit, over to the player who has managed to impress him the most.&quot;)<br /> <br /> If an NPC has an usually high stat (&quot;This character has 6 dots of Strength in Homid form) that might be worth mentioning. Generally though I wouldn't expect a character description to be more than one, maybe two paragraphs at max, and then only for very important NPCs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}